.SH NAME
CSSMathClamp.lower \- CSSMathClamp: lower property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]lower\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]CSSMathClamp\f[R] interface returns a \f[CR]CSSNumericValue\f[R]
object containing the minimum value of a \f[CR]CSSMathClamp\f[R] object.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]CSSNumericValue\f[R].
